<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces continue missile and drone attacks on Saudi targets, including interceptions of missiles and drones by Saudi Arabia and the coalition, while the Houthis deny targeting Mecca. Saudi-led forces and Houthis have exchanged attacks that both sides claim caused heavy losses. Italy reported that EU nations have not committed to Red Sea security, and the EU has been criticised for failing to act. US Republicans blocked efforts to impeach Defence Secretary Pete Hegseth over the Iran war. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/nov/11/donald-trump-pete-hegseth-impeachment-democrats-republicans-arlington-latest-news-updates&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/10/world/middleeast/syria-weighs-sending-troops-to-aid-saudi-war-with-houthis.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/11/democrats-hegseth-impeachment-vote&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPR2R3YVI3eXRmWWFQMHFxdzQ4ekM1US10TDlYQWJHUXlvZmtYQ25nSnN0MXR3ZFZ3T3JocHJpUDEzcTNfWldBa2Z2MEFWRlQyMEd0Y09SdW1wbnU3MWJIZDdMX2R0dy1LM3liekZlcjg0NjdGSXFsWGpZVl9aRG1iSHo0MU4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cxly4y5jzl0qo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/11/us-republicans-block-efforts-to-impeach-us-defence-secretary-pete-hegseth-over-iran-war&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com